    "Software WebGL does not establish the hardware frame budget. PERF-002 and other performance rows remain open.",
    "The preview adds native work and does not accelerate the canonical reader. Full readiness is 69.62\u201389.23 s in these runs, versus an earlier 61.68 s observation with substantial variation; no full-readiness speedup is claimed."
